message: "If you use this project in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "text_to_speech: a modular Text-To-Speech toolkit (Tacotron-2 / WaveGlow / SV2TTS)"
abstract: >-
  Modular Text-To-Speech toolkit built on the yui-mhcp `BaseModel` interface,
  featuring Tacotron-2 synthesis, WaveGlow vocoding and SV2TTS zero-shot voice
  cloning — part of the yui-mhcp projects.
